# Epic Games Launcher for Windows. Environment and helper from frankea/Whisky's
# LauncherPresets.swift (GPL-3.0-or-later). The lighter path without the launcher (legendary) is
# epic.recipe, still to be built.
# Chromium's NVIDIA probe would load D3DMetal's nvapi into the DXVK processes: off there.
name Epic Games Launcher
kind launcher
status experimental
symbol e.square
about Windows-версия лаунчера Epic. Интерфейс через DXVK. Ставится и открывает вход (10/10/2026), вход и игры ещё не проверены.
about-en The Windows version of Epic's launcher. Its window draws through DXVK. Installs and opens the sign-in page (10/10/2026); signing in and games are not tested yet.
bottle epic
installer https://launcher-public-service-prod06.ol.epicgames.com/launcher/api/installer/download/EpicGamesLauncherInstaller.msi /qn
exe C:\Program Files\Epic Games\Launcher\Portal\Binaries\Win64\EpicGamesLauncher.exe
env LC_ALL=en_US.UTF-8
env CEF_DISABLE_SANDBOX=1
dxvk EpicGamesLauncher.exe
dxvk EpicWebHelper.exe
dll EpicGamesLauncher.exe nvapi64=,nvapi=,nvngx=
dll EpicWebHelper.exe nvapi64=,nvapi=,nvngx=
